{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_13","type":"command_execution","command":"/usr/bin/bash -lc \"git status --short; sed -n '4325,4365p' .pose/results/delivery-validation.json; rg -n '256 MiB|4 GiB|clean tree|blob sizes|smudge|CRLF' .pose/specs/2026-11-16-pose-git-snapshot-budget-scales-with-the-tree.md; rg --files .pose/review-bundles | rg '4807c72b8757ffae'; pose recurrence-check --tolerant --window-days 14\"","aggregated_output":"      ],\n      \"severity\": \"required\",\n      \"evidence_class\": \"integration\",\n      \"outcome\": \"pass\",\n      \"duration_seconds\": 0.672911674,\n      \"output\": \"ok  \\tgithub.com/harne8/pose-mcp/internal/pose\\t0.167s\\n\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"pose-mcp/go/git-snapshot-budget-scales-with-the-tree-integration\",\n      \"module\": \"pose-mcp\",\n      \"stack\": \"go\",\n      \"name\": \"git-snapshot-budget-scales-with-the-tree-integration\",\n      \"program\": \"go\",\n      \"args\": [\n        \"test\",\n        \"./internal/pose\",\n        \"-run\",\n        \"TestGitSnapshotBudget\",\n        \"-count=1\"\n      ],\n      \"severity\": \"required\",\n      \"evidence_class\": \"integration\",\n      \"outcome\": \"pass\",\n      \"duration_seconds\": 0.601694767,\n      \"output\": \"ok  \\tgithub.com/harne8/pose-mcp/internal/pose\\t0.039s\\n\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"pose-mcp/go/doctor-recommends-the-commit-graph-integration\",\n      \"module\": \"pose-mcp\",\n      \"stack\": \"go\",\n      \"name\": \"doctor-recommends-the-commit-graph-integration\",\n      \"program\": \"go\",\n      \"args\": [\n        \"test\",\n        \"./internal/cli\",\n        \"-run\",\n        \"TestDoctorRecommendsTheCommitGraph|TestDoctorCommitGraphReportsAnUnreadableHistory|TestDoctorCommitGraphTellsUnbornFromBroken|TestDoctorCommitGraphProbesALiteralPath|TestDoctorCommitGraphNamesDisabledReads\",\n        \"-count=1\"\n      ],\n      \"severity\": \"required\",\n      \"evidence_class\": \"integration\",\n21:Fazer o orçamento de bytes das capturas de Git que comparam o disco com a árvore commitada crescer com o tamanho dessa árvore, em vez de ficar num teto fixo de 256 MiB.\n24:A árvore commitada do pose-dist passou de 256 MiB (256,8 MiB; 88 MiB de review runs e 102 MiB de review bundles). Desde então, todo `pose close` falha em `gitMaterializedChangesForIn` com \"snapshot exceeds 256 MiB\", e toda revisão delegada falha na limpeza do worktree descartável, que tira um `dispatchDiskSnapshot` do mesmo tamanho. Duas specs aprovadas ou em revisão (`pose-review-ledger-is-read-once-per-operation`, `pose-doctor-recommends-the-commit-graph`) ficaram sem poder fechar. As duas capturas precisam ler a árvore inteira para responder; um teto abaixo dela só pode reprovar.\n40:- R1: `gitMaterializedChangesForIn` and `dispatchDiskSnapshot` shall bound the bytes they read by the committed tree's blob sizes plus a 256 MiB margin, so a clean tree of any size up to the ceiling is compared and snapshotted whole.\n42:- R3: The budget shall never be less than the 256 MiB margin and never more than a 4 GiB ceiling; when the committed tree cannot be listed, the disk snapshot shall use the margin alone.\n48:- O teto absoluto de 4 GiB limita o trabalho de uma captura; o disco que cresceu além da árvore mais a margem continua reprovando.\n51:- Para um repositório de até 256 MiB commitados o teto só cresce; nada que passava passa a reprovar.\n98:- Decision: (a), margem de 256 MiB e teto de 4 GiB.\n108:Testes com um repositório real de quatro arquivos de 4 KiB e a margem reduzida a 1 KiB, de modo que a árvore commitada passa da margem, como a do pose-dist passou de 256 MiB.\n120:- Notes: com o teto antigo (só a margem), o teste da árvore inteira reprova com \"snapshot exceeds its budget of 1024 bytes\"; com o orçamento escalonado passa, e um arquivo que cresce 60 KiB além da árvore reprova nas duas capturas. Os fechamentos de `pose-review-ledger-is-read-once-per-operation` e `pose-doctor-recommends-the-commit-graph` reprovaram com \"snapshot exceeds 256 MiB\" sobre a árvore de 256,8 MiB do pose-dist.\nrecurrence.flapping_keys=0\nrecurrence.resolved_clusters=0\nrecurrence.window_days=14\nrecurrence.threshold=3\nrecurrence.records_scanned=432\nrecurrence.flagged_keys=0\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
